Common Type StateEducationAgencyAccountability
    documentation 'This entity maintains information about federal reporting and accountability for 
    'StateEducationAgency(s).
    enumeration SchoolYear
        documentation 'The school year for which the accountability is reported.
        is part of identity
    bool CTEGraduationRateInclusion
        documentation 'An indication of whether CTE concentrators are included in the state's 
        'computation of its graduation rate.
        is optional

